84bf6760cfd0e0f10cad7ea4bd554f075d526cf9c698c6cfa1668a89b470fa116bcdd6a771f181a28f1082391ac050aa5785bfad12e9a020bfc26c832524e4f9  0001-add-qnx-build.patch
"
